# Official qNEP BaTiO3-style recipe, adapted to the small cubic-only ZStar
# compatibility set.  The published BTO model used 500,000 SNES generations
# with these descriptor and loss settings (qNEP SI, Supplementary Note 8).
# This file is intentionally a high-quality candidate, not a claim that the
# small 167-frame data set reproduces the published production model.
version      4
type         3 Ba O Ti
model_type   0
charge_mode  1
cutoff       6 4
n_max        8 6
basis_size   8 6
l_max        4 0
neuron       40
lambda_e     1.0
lambda_f     1.0
lambda_v     0.1
lambda_q     0.1
lambda_z     0.1
# The split has 134 training structures; full-batch avoids noisy updates on
# this small set while remaining well within one A30's memory.
batch        134
population   50
generation   500000
output_interval 1000
